{"h":3395,"lines":[{"w":0.058052164713541687,"x":0.8084224772102836,"t":"Test 1","h":0.014080681143716856,"c":1,"y":0.098337566381528352},{"h":0.0096092089326137442,"t":"AMBER:","x":0.086270123490024414,"y":0.1434512094664534,"w":0.049681975046793614,"c":1},{"x":0.084349718108775423,"w":0.059695625305175776,"c":1,"t":"WILLIAM:","h":0.0088061578703432231,"y":0.15838761872295015},{"y":0.17292193292865499,"w":0.051469535827636706,"h":0.008807296887724636,"c":1,"x":0.084347536542461563,"t":"AMBER:"},{"t":"WILLIAM:","x":0.084318711799353796,"y":0.18591787822185968,"c":1,"h":0.010431685071390251,"w":0.059757639567057291},{"y":0.2601744185081134,"w":0.051440327962239574,"t":"AMBER:","x":0.084362140447035217,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"w":0.059795277913411465,"h":0.010545130753264353,"t":"WILLIAM:","y":0.27307045777987293,"x":0.084299892299691231,"c":1},{"h":0.010364041592403672,"x":0.084324882517721425,"y":0.31676565349683727,"w":0.051514844894409176,"t":"AMBER:","c":1},{"w":0.059741350809733071,"y":0.33129107292698834,"h":0.010382970174153683,"t":"WILLIAM:","c":1,"x":0.084326855948899423},{"x":0.084252660224510625,"c":1,"h":0.0080851890734704446,"w":0.051659288406372059,"y":0.34697484731016415,"t":"AMBER:"},{"h":0.010360824486111309,"t":"WILLIAM:","x":0.082274006006679654,"y":0.37490679704141239,"w":0.06178943634033203,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"What about my passport?","y":0.14244186034052952,"w":0.19341564178466797,"x":0.17489711727528401,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"h":0.013250883392226021,"t":"Oh yes - they will ask to see that.","x":0.17695472831639972,"y":0.15694935204241833,"c":1,"w":0.24897120157877603},{"c":1,"w":0.032921810150146474,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.17151162775776185,"t":"Oк.","x":0.17489711950549022},{"c":1,"x":0.17489711421411508,"t":"I wouldn't get stressed about the interview though. It's just a chance for them to","y":0.18604651152134577,"w":0.58847737630208341,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.20053003554241799,"w":0.60082305908203126,"h":0.013250883392226243,"x":0.17489711233141236,"t":"build a relationship with you - so they can try and match you to a job which you'll","c":1},{"t":"like. So there are questions about personality that they always ask candidates -","w":0.59465021769205728,"x":0.17489711326434976,"y":0.21511627896307295,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"w":0.60493825276692703,"c":1,"t":"fairly basic ones. And they probably won't ask anything too difficult like what your","y":0.22965116265743979,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.17283951548185636},{"y":0.24411071848311539,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"t":"plans are for the future.","x":0.17695473324142175,"w":0.17489711761474608},{"y":0.2586640550643835,"x":0.17693692553896853,"c":1,"t":"Hope not.","h":0.011741657279545903,"w":0.074109687805175767},{"x":0.17489712865331075,"w":0.60493825276692714,"t":"Anyway, there are lots of benefits to using an agency - for example, the interview","h":0.014534883982160629,"y":0.27325581382029607,"c":1},{"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"will be useful because they'll give you feedback on your performance so you can","x":0.17695473457217589,"y":0.28769140142421046,"w":0.59670781453450517,"c":1},{"w":0.14247871398925782,"h":0.013056779778326755,"c":1,"x":0.17465941462371315,"y":0.30101780174851656,"t":"improve next time."},{"c":1,"y":0.31537102452884525,"h":0.013250883392226021,"x":0.17695473843682133,"w":0.4115226236979167,"t":"And they'll have access to jobs which aren't advertised."},{"t":"Exactly - most temporary jobs aren't advertised.","y":0.3298981344894516,"w":0.36026624043782551,"h":0.01445592671316831,"x":0.1768572955882082,"c":1},{"t":"And I expect finding a temporary job this way takes a lot less time - it's much","x":0.17489712519289755,"w":0.57201644897460935,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"y":0.3444767440525125},{"c":1,"t":"easier than ringing up individual companies.","x":0.17695473334855152,"w":0.32716049194335939,"y":0.36042402842101462,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"y":0.37227980046650233,"x":0.17458335002843617,"t":"Yes indeed. Well I think ...","w":0.19818725585937497,"h":0.01611005515737729,"c":1},{"w":0.026748971939086874,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"Q7","x":0.81481481433909853,"y":0.14244186028810168},{"y":0.21366279044930669,"x":0.81481481446255533,"t":"Q8","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.026748971939086874},{"c":1,"t":"Q9","x":0.81481481433909853,"w":0.026748971939086874,"h":0.013081395583944833,"y":0.28633720912531091},{"t":"Q10","y":0.34447674399581829,"x":0.81069958893364591,"h":0.013081395583944833,"w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1},{"x":0.084362140638977789,"h":0.014570836043610536,"c":1,"y":0.42005813938775161,"t":"PART 2","w":0.098765430450439451},{"c":1,"x":0.08636291219955225,"y":0.44619734995057803,"w":0.67707138061523431,"t":"Good morning. My name's Erica Matthews, and I'm the owner of Matthews Island Holidays,","h":0.015393740156373736},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.67901234944661448,"y":0.46220930221889533,"t":"a company set up by my parents. Thank you for coming to this presentation, in which I hope","c":1,"x":0.08641975111332599},{"x":0.084337002766276994,"y":0.47525516541316049,"c":1,"w":0.69142598470052086,"h":0.014321436168729051,"t":"to interest you in what we have to offer. We're a small, family-run company, and we believe in"},{"h":0.014294179505257243,"x":0.086367027005938721,"t":"the importance of the personal touch, so we don't aim to compete with other companies on","w":0.67293268839518239,"c":1,"y":0.48980634610315588},{"x":0.08432700743718978,"w":0.67290573120117181,"h":0.015012894979775759,"c":1,"t":"the number of customers. What we do is build on our many years' experience - more than","y":0.50378915096308829},{"x":0.086419758673924416,"y":0.51884570071096847,"w":0.65432098388671878,"t":"almost any other rail holiday company - to ensure we provide perfect holidays in a small","c":1,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"t":"number of destinations, which we've got to know extremely well.","y":0.5334302324365483,"h":0.01309509131315878,"c":1,"x":0.086419764953653597,"w":0.47736623128255212},{"c":1,"x":0.084362146078464428,"t":"I'Il start with our six-day Isle of Man holiday. This is a fascinating island in the Irish Sea, with","h":0.014555427856804748,"y":0.55523255800634252,"w":0.68106994628906259},{"t":"Wales to the south, England to the east, Scotland to the north and Northern Ireland to the","y":0.56976744172701099,"x":0.082304526619566568,"w":0.66666666666666663,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1},{"y":0.58283059391656811,"c":1,"t":"west. Our holiday starts in Heysham, where your tour manager will meet you, then you'll","h":0.014675215641376749,"x":0.084312492440983058,"w":0.65442835489908857},{"y":0.59883720916906757,"c":1,"t":"travel by ferry to the Isle of Man. Some people prefer to fly from Luton instead, and another","x":0.084362129764882596,"w":0.67695475260416671,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"x":0.086419749217086381,"t":"popular option is to go by train to Liverpool and take a ferry from there.","h":0.013084819375836831,"w":0.52469136555989582,"c":1,"y":0.61336866911015597},{"w":0.68724278767903646,"t":"You have five nights in the hotel, and the price covers five breakfasts and dinners, and lunch","x":0.084362145144286277,"y":0.63515901084653137,"h":0.01455029160732102,"c":1},{"x":0.082304527587293522,"y":0.64958775026563109,"w":0.66049382527669265,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"on the three days when there are organised trips: day four is free, and most people have","c":1},{"t":"lunch in a café or restaurant in Douglas.","y":0.66349634268752222,"w":0.30076838175455728,"c":1,"x":0.084187001075215831,"h":0.015550822335502756},{"t":"The price of the holiday includes the ferry to the Isle of Man, all travel on the island, the hotel,","x":0.086419749210419644,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.69135803222656256,"y":0.68604651150828999,"c":1},{"w":0.66460906982421875,"y":0.70053003554241033,"x":0.086419744819688921,"c":1,"t":"and the meals I've mentioned. Incidentally, we try to make booking our holidays as simple","h":0.013250883392226132},{"h":0.01309337941721278,"c":1,"x":0.086419741055346819,"t":"and fair as possible, so unlike with many companies, the price is the same whether you book","w":0.68930043538411467,"y":0.7151162789501887},{"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.72965116266993768,"x":0.086419755809745119,"c":1,"w":0.64814814249674479,"t":"six months in advance or at the last minute, and there's no supplement for single rooms"},{"w":0.66666666666666674,"x":0.084362139804701142,"y":0.74411071849037314,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"in hotels. If you make a booking then need to change the start date, for example because","c":1},{"y":0.75872093012620856,"w":0.65226338704427078,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"of illness, you're welcome to change to an alternative date or a different tour, for a small","x":0.086419746704202022},{"y":0.77196487766585986,"w":0.14245836893717451,"c":1,"h":0.014510727041040172,"t":"administrative fee.","x":0.084166215381330664},{"y":0.50581395334512025,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.81069958865606528,"t":"Q11","w":0.032921810150146502},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.58430232543537497,"w":0.034979422887166378,"x":0.81069958887240745,"c":1,"t":"Q12"},{"y":0.63517441844621814,"t":"Q13","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.034979422887166378,"x":0.81069958887148874},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.8106995893072485,"t":"Q14","y":0.7427325578911671,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186254},{"c":1,"t":"OK, so what does the holiday consist of? Well, on day one you'll arrive in time for a short","w":0.65647694905598963,"x":0.086368356209049188,"y":0.8138966905841738,"h":0.014170286090972151},{"c":1,"h":0.015739983467668139,"w":0.65853546142578123,"t":"introduction by your tour manager, followed by dinner in the hotel. The dining room looks","y":0.82831254407346988,"x":0.084306714853168735},{"t":"out at the river, close to where it flows into the harbour, and there's usually plenty of activity","y":0.84241135582427784,"w":0.67708470662434883,"h":0.017862403631491164,"c":1,"x":0.084299150944150039},{"w":0.076131687164306655,"c":1,"t":"going on.","y":0.85895170803721232,"x":0.082304526692957153,"h":0.013250883392226132},{"x":0.086370247122542029,"t":"On day two you'll take the coach to the small town of Peel, on the way calling in at the","y":0.87933609422409242,"w":0.63589330037434899,"h":0.013403256734212166,"c":1},{"h":0.015136642366191388,"y":0.89368527755648386,"x":0.086346994691717027,"t":"Tynwald Exhibition. The Isle of Man isn't part of the United Kingdom, and it has its own","w":0.64209569295247393,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.844476744045217,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q15","x":0.81069958887148874,"c":1},{"t":"97","x":0.84156378626571149,"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.014534882858869502,"c":1,"y":0.91715116304004196}],"w":2400}